00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:11,248
Speaking, task three. Story number 13: The new flat. What did Ivan and Olena do last week? Tell the story from the pictures in the past tense.

2
00:00:11,933 --> 00:00:14,142
What did Ivan and Olena do last week?

3
00:00:34,833 --> 00:00:37,631
Last week Ivan and Olena were looking for a new flat.

4
00:00:37,833 --> 00:00:40,999
In the evening they sat at the computer and searched for a flat online.

5
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:43,461
They found a nice flat near the centre.

6
00:00:43,667 --> 00:00:45,161
Then they went to a viewing.

7
00:00:45,367 --> 00:00:48,800
The owner showed them the kitchen, the bedroom and the balcony.

8
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,261
They really liked the flat because it was bright and clean.

9
00:00:52,467 --> 00:00:54,700
The next day they signed the rental contract.

10
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:57,225
They paid the deposit and the first rent.

11
00:00:57,433 --> 00:00:59,457
Finally they got the keys from the owner.

12
00:00:59,667 --> 00:01:02,833
They were very happy because they finally had a place of their own.

